WEBVTT

01:27.785 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

02:07.825 --> 02:08.705
You scared me half to death!

02:09.985 --> 02:11.144
I've been waiting for you forever.

02:14.225 --> 02:17.185
Sneaking out of Linghe Hall
isn't that easy.

02:39.745 --> 02:41.305
What are you drawing?

02:53.625 --> 02:54.785
This is you?

02:56.945 --> 02:58.065
Back in that fire, you got hit?

03:07.385 --> 03:08.985
Want to see my scar?

03:10.105 --> 03:11.705
It's on the back of my neck.

03:43.585 --> 03:45.025
How did you get hurt?

03:47.465 --> 03:48.865
I used to go play with him.

03:49.705 --> 03:51.465
Him? Who is he?

03:54.585 --> 03:56.825
-The Emperor?
-At his place,

03:57.505 --> 04:00.985
there were all sorts of strange,
fun books.

04:03.065 --> 04:05.025
He said they'd been left
by his late mother.

04:08.985 --> 04:11.985
Back then,
I actually liked being around him.

04:15.625 --> 04:17.265
So later,

04:18.425 --> 04:19.624
it was his place that caught fire?

04:25.465 --> 04:26.545
Hurry!

04:27.985 --> 04:29.505
-Quick!
-Coming!

04:30.465 --> 04:31.465
-Hurry up!
-The water's here!

04:31.545 --> 04:32.225
LULING HALL

04:34.705 --> 04:35.865
Faster!

04:37.665 --> 04:39.385
Huan!

04:39.465 --> 04:43.505
-Your Highness, move now!
-Huan, don't go!

04:44.025 --> 04:46.625
Huan, help me!

04:50.625 --> 04:52.705
The fire was so huge.

04:55.705 --> 04:58.425
They even saved all the crickets he kept.

04:59.785 --> 05:01.385
But no one saved me.

05:09.985 --> 05:11.265
He once told me

05:13.465 --> 05:15.505
he'd take good care of me.

05:22.825 --> 05:25.825
All liars deserve to die.

05:38.385 --> 05:39.385
Tell me,

05:43.025 --> 05:44.225
am I right?

06:08.545 --> 06:11.465
LULING HALL

06:30.145 --> 06:32.065
You were planted by Mother herself.

06:33.665 --> 06:35.385
Now you've finally withered away

06:35.905 --> 06:36.745
and left me too.

07:00.825 --> 07:03.865
SPIRIT TABLET OF EMPRESS HE OF GREAT QI

07:32.825 --> 07:33.705
Mother,

07:34.545 --> 07:35.745
I'm here to see you.

07:42.985 --> 07:44.625
Your Majesty, something's wrong.

07:44.705 --> 07:45.865
The Empress has fainted!

08:05.265 --> 08:07.305
Why would the Empress
go to the cold palace?

08:09.545 --> 08:12.865
Tonight, Her Majesty went out
for an appointment with someone.

08:12.945 --> 08:14.305
She wouldn't allow us to follow.

08:14.385 --> 08:16.665
I truly don't know
she went to the cold palace.

08:16.745 --> 08:17.945
Please spare my life!

08:18.865 --> 08:20.945
When did I ever say
I was going to kill you?

08:21.505 --> 08:22.345
All of you, get up.

08:25.305 --> 08:26.185
Your Majesty,

08:26.785 --> 08:28.345
did the Empress

08:29.465 --> 08:31.505
-run into Princess Ying?
-Yes.

08:32.185 --> 08:34.705
She not only ran into her
but also fell right into her trap.

08:35.945 --> 08:36.945
Your Majesty,

08:37.024 --> 08:39.105
your cold sickness
has been flaring up a lot lately.

08:39.185 --> 08:40.105
Your health must come first.

08:40.945 --> 08:43.024
Why don't you return
to the palace to rest?

08:43.105 --> 08:46.705
Here, I'll have the imperial physicians
and maids watch over Her Majesty.

08:50.105 --> 08:52.385
It's fine. You may all withdraw.

08:54.745 --> 08:56.465
-Understood.
-Understood.

09:08.145 --> 09:10.705
You've got that treasure
that drives out every poison,

09:11.225 --> 09:13.065
so I can't poison you.

09:14.065 --> 09:15.625
But you never saw this coming.

09:16.225 --> 09:18.305
I can still use Puppet Incense on you.

09:25.305 --> 09:27.665
This is the famous Puppet Incense.

09:30.225 --> 09:31.345
It's not easy to make.

09:31.945 --> 09:34.705
This is the famous Puppet Incense.

09:35.225 --> 09:36.345
It's not easy to make.

09:39.025 --> 09:39.985
How interesting.

09:41.665 --> 09:42.585
How interesting.

09:49.385 --> 09:50.545
I must forget

09:51.465 --> 09:53.305
that I came to the cold palace today.

09:53.905 --> 09:56.825
I must forget
that I came to the cold palace today.

10:01.025 --> 10:02.665
I hate Xiao Huan

10:03.665 --> 10:05.825
to my very core.

10:05.905 --> 10:07.785
I hate Xiao Huan

10:08.585 --> 10:10.385
to my very core.

10:11.625 --> 10:14.465
I will kill him with my own sword.

10:15.945 --> 10:17.385
I will kill him

10:18.265 --> 10:19.905
with my own sword.

10:27.705 --> 10:29.585
Those who break their word

10:31.225 --> 10:32.985
all deserve to die.

10:35.825 --> 10:37.505
Those who break their word

10:38.185 --> 10:39.745
all deserve to die.

11:16.945 --> 11:18.825
I will kill him with my own sword.

11:26.745 --> 11:27.585
Cangcang!

11:29.865 --> 11:32.225
Those who break their word
all deserve to die.

11:36.865 --> 11:39.505
I will kill him with my own sword.

11:43.665 --> 11:45.705
I hate Xiao Huan

11:46.225 --> 11:48.265
to my very core.

11:48.985 --> 11:50.025
No!

11:52.025 --> 11:54.905
I will kill him with my own sword.

11:58.465 --> 11:59.425
Cangcang,

12:00.065 --> 12:01.665
your heart has been struggling,

12:01.745 --> 12:03.785
because deep down
you don't really want to kill me,

12:03.865 --> 12:04.705
isn't that right?

12:17.465 --> 12:19.225
I may hate him,

12:19.865 --> 12:22.785
but I refuse to be anyone's puppet.

13:00.985 --> 13:01.945
All of you, remember this.

13:02.465 --> 13:05.385
Nothing happened at Linghe Hall
last night.

13:06.265 --> 13:07.145
Understood.

13:08.385 --> 13:10.625
Your Majesty,
Preceptor Du requests an audience.

13:10.705 --> 13:11.545
She says it's an urgent matter.

13:20.145 --> 13:21.185
Your Majesty?

13:22.865 --> 13:25.465
When the Empress wakes up,
be careful with her right arm.

13:26.145 --> 13:27.025
Understood.

13:56.745 --> 13:59.065
So this time no needles, no medicine?

13:59.785 --> 14:01.105
You're really that angry?

14:03.905 --> 14:05.865
I will begin fasting from today

14:06.385 --> 14:07.225
to pray for Your Majesty.

14:09.345 --> 14:11.385
Your stomach is already weak.

14:11.465 --> 14:12.585
Why put yourself through this?

14:12.665 --> 14:14.345
If even Your Majesty
won't take care of yourself,

14:16.865 --> 14:17.745
then,

14:18.425 --> 14:19.265
I won't bother with myself either.

14:23.145 --> 14:25.385
I've ordered Imperial Physician Li back.

14:25.945 --> 14:27.825
So, I'll pull through this trial.

14:34.865 --> 14:35.905
Your Majesty.

14:45.585 --> 14:47.945
When Prince of Yuzhang was escorting
the officials into the Capital,

14:48.025 --> 14:49.065
they were attacked by assassins.

14:49.145 --> 14:51.345
But Prince of Yuzhang wrote
that he was prepared,

14:51.425 --> 14:52.705
and not a single official was injured.

14:54.905 --> 14:57.305
-Not a single one?
-Yes.

14:58.305 --> 15:00.745
I'm afraid
that even if there were casualties,

15:00.825 --> 15:02.945
he wouldn't dare let me know.

15:03.025 --> 15:04.145
Besides,

15:04.225 --> 15:07.185
the one accompanying him into the Capital
wasn't Shi Yan, but Zhong Lin.

15:09.305 --> 15:10.665
She must be coming to see Cangcang, right?

15:12.825 --> 15:13.745
It's fine.

15:14.385 --> 15:17.065
It's about time
Cangcang saw an old friend.

15:17.145 --> 15:19.905
WUYING HALL

15:25.625 --> 15:26.625
Preceptor Du.

15:30.745 --> 15:31.665
Eunuch Feng.

15:33.425 --> 15:35.065
May I ask

15:35.145 --> 15:37.025
where His Majesty has just come back from?

15:37.825 --> 15:38.665
Linghe Hall.

15:48.585 --> 15:50.705
I can manage on my own. I'm fine.

15:51.385 --> 15:54.065
His Majesty specifically instructed us
to be extra careful with your right arm.

15:54.665 --> 15:55.985
So, please let me serve you.

16:01.785 --> 16:03.105
Is His Majesty

16:03.745 --> 16:04.865
all right?

16:04.945 --> 16:06.665
His Majesty missed his medicine,

16:06.745 --> 16:08.905
then spent his inner strength
purging the poison from you,

16:08.985 --> 16:10.345
and even took a sword strike from you.

16:10.865 --> 16:11.705
His condition is very serious.

16:13.025 --> 16:14.985
Your Majesty, Preceptor Du barged in…

16:15.505 --> 16:18.265
Du Tingxin of Nanrong Palace
pays respects to Your Majesty.

16:19.545 --> 16:20.385
Rise, Preceptor Du.

16:24.785 --> 16:25.825
Leave it to me.

16:28.945 --> 16:30.785
Xiaoshan, you all may go.

16:31.385 --> 16:32.625
-Got it.
-Got it.

16:40.665 --> 16:42.585
You came in person.

16:42.665 --> 16:45.425
Something major happened the day
before yesterday?

16:47.505 --> 16:50.425
You were controlled
by Princess Ying's Puppet Incense

16:51.065 --> 16:53.025
and tried to stab His Majesty.

16:57.105 --> 16:59.705
But you dislocated your own arm

17:00.345 --> 17:02.305
to keep His Majesty safe.

17:10.585 --> 17:14.184
You came in person just to tell me this?

17:16.025 --> 17:17.105
Your Majesty is perceptive.

17:18.745 --> 17:20.745
Then I won't hide anything.

17:23.424 --> 17:24.665
Are you aware

17:25.585 --> 17:26.424
of my background?

17:27.545 --> 17:28.385
Please enlighten me.

17:30.465 --> 17:33.465
I'm the former Preceptor's daughter,
not her disciple.

17:35.305 --> 17:37.905
An Imperial Preceptor
was supposed to live a spotless life.

17:39.185 --> 17:42.025
But she had an affair with another man
and secretly gave birth to me.

17:43.585 --> 17:45.385
She raised me as her "disciple".

17:48.665 --> 17:49.985
Later, when the truth came out,

17:51.105 --> 17:53.665
my mother was forced
to burn herself alive to atone.

17:55.505 --> 17:57.265
Her only wish was to keep me safe.

17:58.745 --> 18:00.105
But the ministers

18:00.665 --> 18:02.265
still wouldn't let it go.

18:05.225 --> 18:07.025
I was hiding in the shrine that day.

18:07.105 --> 18:08.345
This girl

18:08.425 --> 18:10.985
is an affront to Heaven and our ancestors.

18:11.065 --> 18:12.665
She has no right to live.

18:13.185 --> 18:14.545
She should be sacrificed to Heaven!

18:35.985 --> 18:36.865
Don't be afraid.

18:37.385 --> 18:39.985
Today, I exercised my right to pardon.

18:40.065 --> 18:41.505
From this day on,

18:41.585 --> 18:42.825
you are the new Imperial Preceptor.

18:42.905 --> 18:44.745
Why did my master

18:45.265 --> 18:47.905
name the shrine "Nanrong Palace"?

18:47.985 --> 18:49.505
Did she think

18:49.585 --> 18:51.785
I was unwelcome to the world?

18:51.865 --> 18:53.105
Even if the world rejects you,

18:53.185 --> 18:55.145
you must fight to live.

18:55.665 --> 18:57.625
The former Preceptor burned herself alive.

18:57.705 --> 19:00.105
Isn't this the very result she sought?

19:14.345 --> 19:15.905
That day, when His Majesty took my hand

19:17.425 --> 19:18.945
and led me out of Nanrong Palace,

19:21.185 --> 19:22.585
I made up my mind

19:24.505 --> 19:27.025
that my whole life
would belong to him alone.

19:32.465 --> 19:34.305
If His Majesty can be
with the one he loves,

19:35.145 --> 19:36.425
that is the greatest joy I could ask for.

19:39.065 --> 19:40.785
You don't actually think

19:40.865 --> 19:42.945
the one His Majesty loves is me, do you?

19:44.985 --> 19:46.705
Why are you so certain it isn't?

19:55.825 --> 19:57.145
Emperors are heartless.

19:57.985 --> 19:59.105
In the end,

19:59.745 --> 20:01.305
power is all he's ever valued.

20:03.545 --> 20:05.145
I came here today

20:06.265 --> 20:08.145
because the night before last,

20:08.225 --> 20:09.745
you were under someone else's control,

20:09.825 --> 20:12.705
yet you chose to injure yourself
rather than harm His Majesty.

20:13.705 --> 20:14.785
I believe

20:16.545 --> 20:17.505
Your Majesty

20:18.225 --> 20:19.865
might truly care for him after all.

20:32.625 --> 20:35.225
I beg Your Majesty
to give His Majesty a little trust.

20:36.385 --> 20:38.825
If affection can grow between you,

20:38.905 --> 20:40.185
then Nanrong Palace

20:40.705 --> 20:43.105
will be Linghe Hall's most loyal ally.

20:47.105 --> 20:48.505
And if I can't?

20:51.345 --> 20:52.465
I should say no more.

20:52.985 --> 20:54.465
Such words would be overstepping.

20:58.305 --> 20:59.665
Your Majesty is still recovering,

21:00.345 --> 21:01.465
so I will take my leave.

21:14.225 --> 21:16.145
WUYING HALL

21:31.585 --> 21:32.665
No…

21:35.665 --> 21:36.625
Wufu,

21:37.265 --> 21:38.345
where is Imperial Physician Li?

21:39.465 --> 21:41.705
They say he'll arrive in the Capital
in about a day.

21:43.945 --> 21:45.145
For the next seven days,

21:45.225 --> 21:46.425
I will not hold morning court.

21:46.505 --> 21:48.865
Announce to the outside world
that I'm recovering from illness.

21:49.385 --> 21:52.025
No one is allowed to visit me.
Not even the Empress.

21:53.105 --> 21:53.945
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:57.545 --> 22:00.585
LING MANOR

22:01.185 --> 22:03.705
Are you sure everyone is dead,

22:04.625 --> 22:06.065
including that Song Lanxi?

22:06.865 --> 22:07.905
They should be.

22:08.825 --> 22:09.945
What is that supposed to mean?

22:10.625 --> 22:12.825
You knew Prince of Yuzhang
would keep them heavily guarded,

22:13.345 --> 22:14.705
so besides ambushing the posthouse,

22:15.705 --> 22:17.305
we also used Li Chengtian's name

22:17.385 --> 22:19.025
to lure Song Lanxi out to kill him.

22:19.105 --> 22:21.385
But in the end,
Prince of Yuzhang's men showed up.

22:21.905 --> 22:24.665
Still, he was gravely wounded
and surely can't survive.

22:26.065 --> 22:29.505
But Xiao Qianqing
has tightened security this time

22:29.585 --> 22:31.065
and even bought so many injury salves.

22:33.065 --> 22:34.585
What if Song Lanxi

22:34.665 --> 22:35.825
didn't actually die?

22:35.905 --> 22:37.025
Father,

22:37.585 --> 22:39.505
I drove my sword through his chest myself.

22:40.025 --> 22:42.865
I imagine Prince of Yuzhang
is just putting up a smokescreen.

22:46.945 --> 22:50.145
This time His Majesty's illness
was severe,

22:52.265 --> 22:55.585
yet he won't let anyone visit him.

22:56.865 --> 22:57.905
All right.

22:57.985 --> 22:59.825
I'll find another way
to find out the truth.

23:00.665 --> 23:01.985
Go make arrangements right away.

23:02.585 --> 23:05.905
Have Xu Feng and his men come see me
before the final exam.

23:07.065 --> 23:07.945
Got it.

23:29.385 --> 23:31.065
Your Majesty is still injured.

23:31.145 --> 23:32.545
The night is getting colder and damper.

23:32.625 --> 23:34.065
You should rest early.

23:36.425 --> 23:39.665
If you're worried about His Majesty,
why not go visit him?

23:39.745 --> 23:41.145
Who said I'm worried about him?

23:41.665 --> 23:44.625
I just slept too much yesterday,

23:45.145 --> 23:46.385
so now I can't fall asleep.

23:48.265 --> 23:50.585
I heard from Wuying Hall

23:50.665 --> 23:52.105
that Imperial Physician Li is back.

23:54.265 --> 23:55.505
Imperial Physician Li?

23:56.705 --> 23:58.985
He's a miracle physician the late Emperor
found out in the martial world.

23:59.065 --> 24:00.905
He was brought in specifically
to treat His Majesty's cold poison.

24:00.985 --> 24:02.585
Preceptor Du takes care of him
in the palace.

24:02.665 --> 24:03.745
Imperial Physician Li

24:03.825 --> 24:05.225
searches the martial world
for medicine for him.

24:06.065 --> 24:08.465
This time they've brought Li back,

24:09.305 --> 24:12.305
so it seems His Majesty's condition
is truly dangerous.

24:13.905 --> 24:16.025
-Is that true?
-Yeah.

24:16.105 --> 24:17.705
Your Majesty really won't go see him?

24:31.705 --> 24:35.025
Physician Li, you still have
those miraculous healing hands.

24:35.105 --> 24:36.425
Your medicine cures me in no time.

24:38.025 --> 24:39.185
Cure you, my foot!

24:39.825 --> 24:41.385
You brat, if you're so eager to die,

24:41.465 --> 24:43.825
why drag me back in such a hurry?

24:45.985 --> 24:47.665
-Physician Li!
-Keep quiet!

24:47.745 --> 24:49.545
I'm trying to think of a way!

25:10.345 --> 25:12.705
Inside the palace,
is there a woman this brat actually likes,

25:12.785 --> 25:14.305
one who also has inner strength?

25:21.985 --> 25:23.505
To suppress your cold poison,

25:23.585 --> 25:25.905
the medicine I'm using is blazing hot.

25:25.985 --> 25:29.025
We need a woman of extreme yin
and softness to help.

25:35.505 --> 25:37.465
Your Majesty, the Empress is here.

25:40.465 --> 25:41.305
Send her back.

25:43.265 --> 25:45.185
Your Majesty, please reconsider.

25:46.705 --> 25:48.225
Let the Empress in!

25:48.985 --> 25:51.385
Her Majesty arrives!

26:02.745 --> 26:03.945
Your Majesty.

26:09.985 --> 26:11.025
You're the right person!

26:15.985 --> 26:17.745
That brat's already sick like that,

26:17.825 --> 26:20.145
yet he straightens right up
the moment you walk in.

26:20.225 --> 26:21.905
That means he likes you.

26:21.985 --> 26:23.145
Let me just ask you one thing:

26:23.745 --> 26:25.625
Are you going to save
that brat's life or not?

26:40.985 --> 26:42.185
Physician Li was exaggerating.

26:42.705 --> 26:43.705
It's not a life-or-death matter.

26:47.785 --> 26:48.985
Either way,

26:49.585 --> 26:50.425
I hurt you.

26:51.745 --> 26:54.625
Xiao Ying dosed you with Puppet Incense.
It's not your fault.

26:57.225 --> 26:58.065
I do hate you.

26:58.145 --> 26:59.385
However,

26:59.465 --> 27:01.745
I also don't want you
to just die without even knowing why.

27:02.825 --> 27:03.825
I don't like dragging things out.

27:03.905 --> 27:05.345
Let's get through this first.

28:17.065 --> 28:19.545
I'm here with you. I'll protect you!

28:44.505 --> 28:46.265
Why did you kill my master?

28:48.065 --> 28:49.545
I promised him

28:50.225 --> 28:51.345
I wouldn't tell you.

28:57.385 --> 28:58.505
What did you just say?

29:03.665 --> 29:04.905
You can't tell me what?

29:44.625 --> 29:45.465
You're awake.

29:47.865 --> 29:49.425
Why am I sleeping here?

29:52.745 --> 29:53.585
You're all right now?

29:55.585 --> 29:57.465
Physician Li pulled me through.

29:57.545 --> 29:59.745
My health
should be stable for a while now.

30:01.625 --> 30:02.945
That's great!

30:08.305 --> 30:09.985
If there's nothing else,

30:10.065 --> 30:11.105
I'll be going now.

30:18.705 --> 30:19.545
What's wrong?

30:20.505 --> 30:21.345
You had your reasons?

30:23.185 --> 30:24.025
What reasons?

30:25.905 --> 30:27.225
You had your reasons

30:28.625 --> 30:29.665
for killing my master?

30:31.305 --> 30:32.305
Why do you ask about that?

30:34.465 --> 30:35.545
It's nothing.

30:36.785 --> 30:38.105
I just think

30:38.185 --> 30:41.185
even if the Bai Chifan I once knew
wore a thousand faces,

30:42.505 --> 30:43.785
he couldn't possibly have

30:44.305 --> 30:45.945
every single one of them be a lie.

30:51.465 --> 30:52.465
Right now,

30:52.545 --> 30:54.545
come with me to the cold palace.

30:55.425 --> 30:56.265
What?

31:30.465 --> 31:31.585
Do you all know

31:32.185 --> 31:33.865
what "cold palace" really means?

31:37.785 --> 31:40.785
Anyone not from Xuanguang Hall,
step forward.

31:49.665 --> 31:52.225
If there's a single lie,
your whole clan will die!

32:03.345 --> 32:04.945
Well then.

32:05.025 --> 32:06.825
So you're all from Xuanguang Hall!

32:09.985 --> 32:11.665
Bullying servants?

32:13.265 --> 32:14.185
That's nothing to be proud of.

32:45.345 --> 32:46.185
Xiao Huan!

32:48.665 --> 32:50.985
These are all my favorite things.

32:51.745 --> 32:52.665
How dare you destroy them!

32:54.385 --> 32:56.505
If you dare lay a hand on my empress,
there's nothing I won't dare do.

32:57.865 --> 32:59.505
-Li Hongqing!
-Here.

32:59.585 --> 33:01.985
Throw all these bottles and jars

33:02.065 --> 33:02.985
and the herbs and old books

33:03.065 --> 33:04.585
into the courtyard to be burned!

33:05.705 --> 33:06.745
Xiao Huan, don't you dare…

33:06.825 --> 33:08.705
The Empress Dowager arrives!

33:11.225 --> 33:12.665
Well, she's here at just the right time.

33:27.145 --> 33:30.145
Your Majesty, why are you here personally?

33:31.425 --> 33:34.505
And, why are you rushing here
in such haste?

33:35.225 --> 33:37.945
Governing the inner palace is my duty.

33:38.025 --> 33:40.585
Your Majesty should not interfere
in the affairs of the inner palace.

33:42.145 --> 33:43.585
I truly shouldn't have.

33:44.105 --> 33:46.545
But the Princess used forbidden arts
on my empress.

33:47.985 --> 33:49.945
That leaves me no choice.

33:55.985 --> 33:59.545
As I see it,
the Empress is perfectly fine,

34:00.705 --> 34:02.425
yet the Princess has been frightened.

34:03.225 --> 34:05.225
Such a great incident happened
in Linghe Hall,

34:05.825 --> 34:07.025
and you knew nothing of it?

34:09.625 --> 34:10.465
The Empress

34:10.545 --> 34:12.264
was put under Puppet Incense.

34:12.344 --> 34:16.344
Had she really killed me,
that would've pleased you, wouldn't it?

34:18.264 --> 34:19.105
Please, quell your anger.

34:20.185 --> 34:22.065
It was indeed my oversight in this matter.

34:22.705 --> 34:24.425
I will certainly get to the bottom of it

34:24.945 --> 34:26.505
and give the Empress an explanation.

34:27.425 --> 34:28.824
If it truly was the Princess's doing,

34:29.705 --> 34:31.225
I will by no means be lenient.

34:33.865 --> 34:34.824
Aren't you tired?

34:36.344 --> 34:37.585
You are already advanced in years,

34:38.105 --> 34:39.705
yet still labor over the inner palace.

34:40.304 --> 34:41.625
It's forgivable to overlook small matters,

34:42.145 --> 34:43.784
but to blunder over major ones?

34:43.865 --> 34:45.344
In my view,

34:45.425 --> 34:47.784
the Phoenix Seal
might as well be handed to the Empress.

34:59.065 --> 35:00.265
You're absolutely right.

35:02.385 --> 35:05.545
Since the Princess used forbidden arts,
she indeed should be severely punished.

35:06.465 --> 35:08.145
I ask you to make the final judgment.

35:15.065 --> 35:17.345
All guards here are to be replaced.

35:18.305 --> 35:19.665
The Princess
is not to leave the cold palace!

35:20.705 --> 35:22.825
For the next ten days,
no lamps are to be lit!

35:24.065 --> 35:25.025
I don't want this!

35:25.665 --> 35:28.025
Qianqing! Qianqing, save me!

35:28.105 --> 35:28.945
Qianqing!

35:29.025 --> 35:31.985
-The Princess isn't herself.
-Qianqing.

35:32.065 --> 35:33.425
-Your Majesty…
-Qianqing, save me!

35:33.505 --> 35:34.385
-Isn't this too cruel?
-Qianqing!

35:36.145 --> 35:36.985
Qianqing, save me!

35:37.065 --> 35:38.225
-I'm cruel?
-Qianqing!

35:39.185 --> 35:40.425
Qianqing, save me…

35:40.505 --> 35:42.065
-As for cruelty…
-Qianqing, save me.

35:42.145 --> 35:44.025
I'm no match for you.

35:50.385 --> 35:51.785
Don't forget

35:52.305 --> 35:54.985
who really set the fire

35:55.065 --> 35:56.185
that turned Xiao Ying into this.

36:11.185 --> 36:12.265
Your Majesty,

36:12.985 --> 36:13.945
please punish the Princess severely.

36:17.425 --> 36:19.105
Since it's your request,

36:19.745 --> 36:21.505
I'll do exactly as I just said.

36:35.025 --> 36:36.305
You say you're afraid of the dark,

36:36.905 --> 36:37.745
but Xiao Ying,

36:38.745 --> 36:41.105
you've never truly seen real darkness.

36:42.305 --> 36:44.705
You know what?
I have never owed you anything.

37:01.385 --> 37:02.785
Li Hongqing,
take charge of the cold palace.

37:03.745 --> 37:04.585
From today on,

37:05.105 --> 37:07.705
the Princess is to be guarded
by the Imperial Guards.

37:55.465 --> 37:57.425
My dear, have you gone soft?

38:02.225 --> 38:03.945
So in this deep palace,

38:05.225 --> 38:07.785
the bond between siblings
and the love between mother and daughter

38:08.305 --> 38:09.585
all end up like this.

38:13.265 --> 38:15.105
Today I've seen

38:16.065 --> 38:17.025
your ruthless side.

38:36.265 --> 38:37.105
Your Majesty,

38:37.905 --> 38:39.625
I dare not ask for much.

38:39.705 --> 38:41.065
I only ask

38:41.145 --> 38:43.505
that for the sake of saving you yesterday,

38:43.585 --> 38:45.025
you allow me to leave the palace once.

38:48.785 --> 38:50.825
Very well, I grant it.

38:51.985 --> 38:53.905
As for what happened at Wuying Hall
last night,

38:53.985 --> 38:56.025
I hope you won't mention it to anyone.

38:56.105 --> 38:57.625
All you need to know

38:58.145 --> 39:01.065
is that my illness is severe,
and hard to recover from.

39:04.385 --> 39:05.225
All right.

39:26.545 --> 39:30.505
WUYING HALL

39:56.625 --> 39:58.785
Say whatever you want to say.

39:58.865 --> 40:00.065
Don't hold anything back.

40:00.585 --> 40:02.705
Then I'll be blunt.

40:03.465 --> 40:05.185
This cold sickness of yours

40:05.265 --> 40:07.065
has only been temporarily suppressed.

40:08.985 --> 40:12.865
I knew it! You missed the key point.

40:12.945 --> 40:13.905
It's only temporary!

40:13.985 --> 40:15.865
If you keep wearing yourself out
like this,

40:15.945 --> 40:18.545
even a great immortal
wouldn't be able to save your little life!

40:19.585 --> 40:22.385
Physician Li,
surely you won't abandon me, right?

40:25.225 --> 40:26.545
You brat, always clinging to me!

40:26.625 --> 40:28.465
You're that certain
I can actually cure your cold sickness?

40:29.265 --> 40:30.505
Physician Li,

40:30.585 --> 40:32.625
you've found a new prescription,
haven't you?

40:36.985 --> 40:40.345
In an ancient text,
I found a herb called Frost Reed.

40:40.425 --> 40:41.385
It grows in the southwest.

40:41.465 --> 40:44.185
When it blooms,
its roots fall into a false death.

40:44.265 --> 40:47.185
They need thirty-six years
to revive and bloom again.

40:47.265 --> 40:49.625
It takes thirty-six years
for a single flower to bloom!

40:50.865 --> 40:53.625
A bizarre flower like that
must be hard to get, right?

40:56.345 --> 40:58.065
That's none of your concern.

40:58.705 --> 41:01.945
All these years, I've been roaming
the martial world searching for it.

41:02.545 --> 41:03.545
Recently,

41:03.625 --> 41:05.385
my people sent back good news.

41:05.465 --> 41:07.025
It seems they've found the flower.

41:07.105 --> 41:08.385
If we can actually get our hands on it,

41:08.465 --> 41:09.625
my prescription will finally be complete.

41:09.705 --> 41:11.745
Then I'd have about
a seventy percent chance

41:11.825 --> 41:14.025
of curing your cold sickness.

41:15.025 --> 41:15.905
Good.

41:16.425 --> 41:19.185
Then, I'll leave it to you.

41:20.345 --> 41:21.465
I might just scrape by

41:21.985 --> 41:22.945
for a few more years.

41:23.625 --> 41:25.825
If you keep acting like this,

41:25.905 --> 41:27.065
my life will get shortened instead!

41:27.145 --> 41:31.065
With your skill and kindness,
you'll live long for sure.

41:31.745 --> 41:33.625
If I make it over a hundred days,

41:33.705 --> 41:36.025
that'll already be a miracle
from my ancestors.

41:36.105 --> 41:39.145
You little brat!
Sometimes I really want to…

41:55.425 --> 41:56.265
Hongqing.

41:56.865 --> 41:59.065
Tomorrow, escort the Empress
to the Summer Palace to escape the heat.

41:59.745 --> 42:00.905
Yes, Your Majesty.
I'll make the arrangements at once.

42:00.985 --> 42:03.705
After you've seen her out of the Capital,
come straight back to the palace.

42:03.785 --> 42:04.625
You don't need to worry about her.

42:05.225 --> 42:07.465
A lot happened today. I forgot to ask:

42:08.505 --> 42:10.385
Has Prince of Yuzhang arrived
in the Capital?

42:10.985 --> 42:12.145
Your Majesty,

42:12.865 --> 42:15.065
Prince of Yuzhang requests an audience.
He's waiting outside.

42:16.185 --> 42:17.305
Speak of him, and here he comes.

42:19.985 --> 42:21.665
I won't see him. Send him back.

42:22.665 --> 42:23.585
Yes, Your Majesty.

42:24.465 --> 42:25.385
I heard that this time,

42:25.465 --> 42:27.345
Princess Ying drugged the Empress
and even forced her

42:27.425 --> 42:29.105
to wound His Majesty.

42:29.185 --> 42:30.905
Only then did His Majesty get angry
and punish Princess Ying.

42:31.865 --> 42:33.865
Ying may be at fault,

42:33.945 --> 42:36.265
but he knows she's terrified of the dark.

42:36.345 --> 42:37.785
Why sentence her to ten days
without a single lamp?

42:37.865 --> 42:41.465
WUYING HALL

42:41.545 --> 42:43.105
Your Highness,

42:43.185 --> 42:45.305
His Majesty is unwell today

42:45.385 --> 42:46.665
and has already retired.

42:47.265 --> 42:50.145
Please come pay your respects another day.

42:50.785 --> 42:52.785
Got it. Thank you, Eunuch Feng.

42:56.705 --> 42:58.385
After so long apart,

42:58.905 --> 43:01.505
he really has prepared
quite the homecoming gift.

43:01.585 --> 43:04.545
LINGHE HALL
